// FORWARD-FREEZE RECEIPT for the host fold that derives gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.roster and
// gunbc.rung_drop.roster from sibling row files and contributes them to the compiler's input IN
// MEMORY. The AcquiredDag impl methods (on_disk, path, is_derived, read) are not separately citable
// as DeclarationRefs and are enumerated here instead; they are covered by the AcquiredDag row's
// purpose and retire with it. gunbc.seed_growth_admission seed_growth_forward_freeze_policy_note
// makes unenumerated hand growth in src/v1 a stop-line. The PR body pointing at
// gunbc.guarantee_stall.roster_re_enumerates_its_own_rows_stall is the right dissolution
// CONTENT and is not a substitute for enumerating the added items (DESIGN §5: a dissolution
// condition does not authorize creating the debt).
//
// THE POPULATION IS THE ADDED HAND ITEMS, not a count. Inline test modules are scopes: WholeDeclaration
// on the module does not cover members (item_declaration_ref_in folds enclosing_module into each
// member). Test items are in: there is no production-only exemption.
//
// cli_run.rs and claim_executor.rs were MODIFIED (the parse-sweep call site and the join rider
// already existed). Those are ExistingSeedItemModified, not netted against the additions below.
// JoinFindingKind gained two variants on an existing enum: same disposition.
